rocalc — pre-renewal Ragnarok Online calculator
  ROratorio -> Doddler -> Gandi -> Triper -> Kurimet

  rocalc is the trusted upstream pre-renewal calculator this project drives
  via a thin shim. The calc itself is not bundled with this repository —
  users supply their own copy of Kurimet's files into vendor/rocalc/ (or
  whichever calc they wish to use). The formulas reflect many years of
  community refinement across the maintainer lineage above.

Hercules — Ragnarok Online server emulator
