  Licensed GPLv3.

rAthena — Ragnarok Online server emulator
  https://github.com/rathena/rathena
  Licensed GPLv3.

  The embedded catalog (internal/catalog/catalog.json) is built from the
  pre-renewal item, mob, and skill databases shipped with these emulators.
  This project's parsers read their db trees and produce an iRO-IDed
  catalog. The catalog inherits the upstream license.
